1
00:00:00,556 --> 00:00:02,606
Security is not one tool.

2
00:00:03,156 --> 00:00:05,886
It is an approach plus
a set of principles.

3
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:09,366
Both matter,
and both come from the syllabus.

4
00:00:11,122 --> 00:00:13,732
Stallings gives three security approaches.

5
00:00:14,327 --> 00:00:17,097
Preventive stops an
attack before it happens.

6
00:00:17,647 --> 00:00:20,257
Detective notices it while it happens.

7
00:00:20,862 --> 00:00:23,092
Corrective fixes it after it happens.

8
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:27,426
Preventive mechanisms block the attack.

9
00:00:27,911 --> 00:00:28,861
Encryption.

10
00:00:29,376 --> 00:00:30,406
Firewalls.

11
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:32,151
Access control.

12
00:00:32,801 --> 00:00:34,511
Stop it before it starts.

13
00:00:36,056 --> 00:00:37,326
Detective mechanisms

14
00:00:37,736 --> 00:00:38,806
watch for trouble.

15
00:00:39,251 --> 00:00:40,601
Intrusion detection.

16
00:00:41,331 --> 00:00:42,281
Audit logs.

17
00:00:42,931 --> 00:00:44,661
Catch it while it is happening.

18
00:00:46,422 --> 00:00:48,852
Corrective mechanisms clean up after.

19
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:50,137
Patches.

20
00:00:50,742 --> 00:00:52,312
Recovery procedures.

21
00:00:52,912 --> 00:00:54,802
Fix the damage and move on.

22
00:00:56,456 --> 00:00:58,126
Kahate gives the principles.

23
00:00:58,761 --> 00:01:00,011
Defense in depth:

24
00:01:00,581 --> 00:01:01,511
layered protection,

25
00:01:02,001 --> 00:01:03,991
no single mechanism suffices.

26
00:01:04,606 --> 00:01:07,676
Least privilege:
minimum permissions needed.

27
00:01:08,241 --> 00:01:11,031
Fail-safe defaults: deny by default.

28
00:01:12,789 --> 00:01:13,639
Three more.

29
00:01:14,179 --> 00:01:15,629
Economy of mechanism:

30
00:01:16,339 --> 00:01:19,549
small, simple designs
are easier to verify.

31
00:01:20,339 --> 00:01:21,489
Complete mediation:

32
00:01:21,959 --> 00:01:23,209
check every access.

33
00:01:23,904 --> 00:01:28,834
Psychological acceptability:
security must not impede usability.

34
00:01:30,656 --> 00:01:31,886
Two final ones.

35
00:01:32,506 --> 00:01:37,536
Weakest link: security level equals
the security of the weakest component.

36
00:01:38,136 --> 00:01:43,686
Separation of duties: split duties
so collusion is required to subvert.

37
00:01:45,356 --> 00:01:48,146
Approaches stop, find and fix attacks.

38
00:01:48,751 --> 00:01:50,501
Principles guide the design.

39
00:01:51,056 --> 00:01:52,946
Everything else builds on these.

